{"about_the_game":"Try to Survive! - is an endless game where the player have to survive and kill creatures that want to kill him. At the same time, improving skills will affect the style of his game. The goal is to survive as long as possible and reach the best score.<br><br>In the forest you can find barrels with fuel, which can help you to kill monsters.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366310/extras/23236a1f4f4822706928141355b3ff6f.poster.avif?t=1602621792\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366310/extras/23236a1f4f4822706928141355b3ff6f.webm?t=1602621792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366310/extras/23236a1f4f4822706928141355b3ff6f.mp4?t=1602621792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After each wave you can choose skill to upgrade.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366310/extras/b413751457f88170b34fc99cbd1621e5.poster.avif?t=1602621792\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366310/extras/b413751457f88170b34fc99cbd1621e5.webm?t=1602621792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366310/extras/b413751457f88170b34fc99cbd1621e5.mp4?t=1602621792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Be careful, because monsters can come from anywhere.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366310/extras/3fd9ac09add9563e20beff4af69a92cb.poster.avif?t=1602621792\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https